     "titulo": "Ordering steps",
     "texto": [
      "**D'abord** (first), **ensuite** (then), **puis** (next), **enfin** (finally).",
      "Example: **D'abord, je prends le train. Ensuite, j'arrive à la gare. Enfin, j'arrive au bureau** (first I take the train, then I arrive at the station, finally I arrive at the office)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Careful with «enfin»",
     "texto": [
      "**Enfin** is not always the last step: it also means «at last» when you are fed up waiting."
